! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# The ONLY STEOM-stable in-protein region: CR2 + Tyr203 phenol ring (His148 in MM) = the
# 44-atom model that gave 500.9 nm. Re-run with STEOM natural transition orbitals so we can
# plot the bright-state STEOM transition density (more accurate than TDDFT; drives coupling J).
# Identical to the proven steom_svp_c8 run + DoSTEOMNatTransOrb.
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 5
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
  DoSTEOMNatTransOrb true
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_cthrp.xyz
